plugins/mdkit - notices for the packages built here (mdkit.pi, mdkit.efm, mdkit.trx: MD-PI, MD-EFM, MD-TRX)

The drum voices are mdkit's (https://github.com/soejrd/mdkit, commit 96157fe4fbda17bf4cae3168f52437d8232e6570),
fetched by fetch.sh into vendor/ and compiled unchanged into the packages, except that PI-CC, PI-HH and PI-RC get
their delay memory windowed (patch_pi.py: 4096 of its 65536 words kept, the 1024 the voices use among them; the
output is checked bit for bit against the unwindowed voices). Their source is not in this repository.

